---
title: "fix_review_process (Sherlock Watsons)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_schedule: protocol selects fix review date (within 3 weeks of audit end)
    q_schedule --> q_lead_response: lead senior watson responds
    q_lead_response --> q_confirmed: confirms date
    q_lead_response --> q_alt_date: proposes alternative date
    q_lead_response --> q_unavailable: no reasonable availability
    q_confirmed --> q_review: lead watson conducts fix review
    q_alt_date --> q_review: lead watson conducts fix review
    q_unavailable --> q_forfeit_25: lose 25% fixed pay
    q_forfeit_25 --> q_reassign: 25% used to compensate replacement watson
    q_reassign --> q_review: replacement watson conducts fix review
    q_review --> q_scope_check: evaluate scope of protocol changes
    q_scope_check --> q_small_changes: changes reviewable in 1 day
    q_scope_check --> q_large_changes: changes require > 1 day
    q_large_changes --> q_new_contest: schedule follow-up contest (3 days to 3 weeks)
    q_new_contest --> q_priority_lead: original lead gets first priority for new contest
    q_priority_lead --> [*]: fix review via new contest
    q_small_changes --> q_review_done: fix review completed
    q_review_done --> q_bounty_window: 2-week pre-launch bounty window
    q_bounty_window --> q_no_critical: no critical issues found in fix review scope
    q_bounty_window --> q_critical_found: critical issue found (introduced after audit)
    q_no_critical --> q_release_25: 25% fixed pay released
    q_critical_found --> q_reroute: some/all 25% rerouted to bounty submitter
    q_release_25 --> [*]: fix review pay complete
    q_reroute --> [*]: fix reviewer penalized

    note right of q_lead_response
        INV-001: Protocol must select date within 3 weeks of audit end
        INV-002: Unavailability forfeits 25% of fixed pay
    end note

    note right of q_scope_check
        INV-003: If changes exceed 1-day review, a new contest is required
        INV-004: Original lead gets first priority for follow-up contest
    end note

    note right of q_bounty_window
        INV-005: Critical bugs from original audit scope do not penalize fix reviewer
        INV-006: Only bugs introduced after original audit penalize fix reviewer
        INV-007: 25% pay released after 2-week bounty window if no issues
    end note
